flowchart TD
  A["Reconstruct recent failed departures"] --> B{"Repeated, costly, preventable loss pool?"}
  B -->|"No"| S1["Stop: address capacity, staffing, policy, parts, or weather exposure"]
  B -->|"Yes"| C["Run configured-stack and process comparator"]
  C --> D{"Cheapest adequate fix works?"}
  D -->|"Yes"| S2["Recommend the fix; stop product motion"]
  D -->|"No"| E["Read-only Suntiq shadow test"]
  E --> F{"Earlier evidence changes a staff decision?"}
  F -->|"No"| S3["Narrow or kill the wedge"]
  F -->|"Yes"| G["Measured free pilot: owned action, closure, outcome, support cost"]
  G --> H{"Operating outcome and economics pass?"}
  H -->|"No"| S4["Do not scale"]
  H -->|"Yes"| I["Dated intended-price rollout decision"]
